  "bodyHash": "QE32NtVPCx0=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异怪物将Minecraft的生物推向恐怖的新高度！与标志性生物的变异版本战斗，每个都拥有毁灭性的能力和独特的奖励。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">击败变异僵尸、骷髅、苦力怕、末影人等，每一个都带来全新的挑战。制作强力物品，驯服爆炸性仆从，并发现像蜘蛛猪这样的奇怪新生物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">准备好迎接史诗般的战斗和传奇战利品吧，在这个生存无法保证的世界里！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 特色变异体</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异僵尸</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一个拥有强力猛击攻击的庞大 brute。击败它可获得强大的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">浩克之锤</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异骷髅</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一个致命的射手。击败它后，可用其骨头制作</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异骷髅盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：通过连锁爆炸造成严重破坏。死亡时掉落一个</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕仆从蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异末影人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一个会瞬移的恐怖存在。切断它的手，用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">末影灵魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">获得它的力量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☃️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异雪傀儡</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一个强大的盟友，向敌人投掷巨大的冰块。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👾 仆从与伙伴</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕仆从</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：从</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕仆从蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">中孵化的爆炸性盟友。使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕仆从追踪器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">来驯服和追踪它们。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">蜘蛛猪</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一种快速且不可预测的生物，通过在吃了发酵蛛眼的猪身上使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">化学X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">创造。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 特殊物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">化学X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一种神秘的液体，能将生物变异为强大的变异体或奇怪的新生物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">浩克之锤</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一把猛击地面并击退敌人的强大武器。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">末影灵魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：从变异末影人那里获得瞬移和方块操控能力。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一种有毒的武器，在地形上使用时会引起爆炸。通过摧毁</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕仆从蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">获得。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕仆从追踪器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一种追踪和控制你的苦力怕仆从的设备。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异骷髅盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异骷髅骨头</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">制作强大的盔甲。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端和服务器均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可以直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行配置（需要安装</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（由</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">制作）用于Fabric）。请注意，在较旧的Minecraft版本中，还需要安装</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，文件名分别为</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有类型都存在于每个模组中，甚至可能完全没有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衷心感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shcott21</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他在多年前最初以</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mutant Creatures</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">的名义发布了这个模组。大部分工作以及所有令人惊叹的模型都是由他完成的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Chumbanotz</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他是第一个以</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mutant Beasts</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">模组的形式将变异体带入现代Minecraft的人，为这次最终复兴奠定了基础。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">非常感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tdstress\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">tdstress</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他重做了模组中的所有纹理，以匹配新的Minecraft艺术风格！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/echo-chest\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/echochest/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-descriptions\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectdescriptions/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dyed-flames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/dyedflames/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
